WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.869
The House held
its first public hearings

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.304
in the impeachment inquiry
today.

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.905
And there was a major
new bombshell

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.306
about President Trump's
involvement

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:08.508
in the Ukraine scandal.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.677
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.246
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.282
Today was a historic day.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.050
This was only the fourth time
in American history

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.653
that Congress has launched
public impeachment proceedings

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.921
against a sitting president.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.090
And that is not a club
you want to be in.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.992
There are the two presidents
who actually got impeached

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.260
and the third, Richard Nixon,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.628
who was so desperate
to avoid it, he quit first.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:32.665
Remember the famous shot of
Nixon getting on the helicopter?

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.667
If that had been Trump,
the Secret Service would have to

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.471
tie him to the helicopter
by his leg and airlift him out.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.908
[ As Donald Trump ]
Please drop me off at a Wendy's.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:45.077
[ Normal voice ]
Democrats have already collected
reams of damning evidence

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:47.013
and witness testimony
in private depositions.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.881
That evidence has been
so compelling,

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:51.517
even some conservatives have
called for Trump's impeachment,

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:52.885
like George Conway,

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.721
the husband of White House
counselor Kellyanne Conway.

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:59.058
Conway made a rare TV appearance
on MSNBC today,

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:00.560
where he was asked specifically

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.928
how he talks about
his criticisms of Trump

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:04.564
with fellow Republicans.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.699
-This is about the country,

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:09.368
people doing the right thing
by the country

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.771
and not by their party.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.939
And this is about
telling the truth

00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:15.508
about what really happened

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.576
and not about party loyalty.

00:01:17.576 --> 00:01:19.645
-Are you disappointed
that Republicans

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.347
don't seem to see it that way?

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.950
-I'm horrified.
I'm appalled.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.418
-If you're alone
with a Republican --

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.789
You spent your career
in Republican legal causes.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.425
What is the case to
the Republicans you've known

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.993
your whole professional life?

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:37.963
-Well, the case is,
take that Republican hat off

00:01:37.963 --> 00:01:40.399
and look at it neutrally.

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:42.868
-It is so weird to watch them
dance around the fact

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.871
that he's married
to Kellyanne Conway.

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:48.407
"So what do you say if you're
alone with a Republican,

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:51.711
say in a kitchen or in a car
on the way to dinner?

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.913
What do you tell the Republicans
you've known your whole life,

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.881
say Republicans
you've exchanged vows with?

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:56.949
Just one more.

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.517
You're married
to Kellyanne Conway!

00:01:58.517 --> 00:02:00.953
What is going on here?!"

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:02.388
Now, once again...

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.723
[ Applause ]

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:07.927
Once the hearing began,
Democratic chairman Adam Schiff

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.196
laid out all the evidence
Democrats have collected,

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.264
all of which
is also publicly known.

00:02:12.264 --> 00:02:13.966
And there was one crucial point
he made

00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:15.234
that is worth remembering.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:17.604
-The questions presented
by this impeachment inquiry

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:18.738
are whether President Trump

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.807
sought to exploit
that ally's vulnerability

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.877
and invite Ukraine's
interference in our elections.

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:28.681
The facts in the present inquiry
are not seriously contested.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.082
-That's true.

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:32.251
Republicans haven't actually
contested any of the facts.

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.653
In fact, they've basically
admitted to all of it.

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:35.788
We have the transcript

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.356
where Trump mentioned
the Bidens by name

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:38.724
and told the Ukrainian
president,

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:40.192
"I would like you
to do us a favor."

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:42.562
Trump and his chief of staff
have confessed on TV.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.264
And Rudy Giuliani
has done multiple interviews

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:47.166
where he actually showed off
his communications

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.169
with Trump officials
on his phone and his iPad

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:51.237
on national television.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.339
You know you're a bad criminal

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:57.577
when you keep the evidence
against you on multiple devices.

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:00.546
I'd love to see
the storage chart on his phone.

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:02.381
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:06.251
[ Cheers and applause ]
Rudy --

00:03:06.251 --> 00:03:09.255
Rudy's like a bank robber
who says, "Look at my Fitbit.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.524
I took 1,000 steps from my house
to the bank

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:12.958
and then to my getaway car."

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:14.560
Republicans have not challenged

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.596
any of the central facts
of the case,

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:19.031
so instead
they just resort to lies.

00:03:19.031 --> 00:03:21.133
Take Republican congressman
Devin Nunes,

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:22.501
who decided to double down

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:24.871
on a bunch of ridiculous
conspiracy theories.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.806
For example,
during his opening statement,

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.207
he made a truly insane claim

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.509
that had nothing to do with
the actual Ukraine scandal.

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:32.344
-We're asked to simply forget

00:03:32.344 --> 00:03:34.614
about Democrats
on this committee

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:38.517
falsely claiming they had more
than circumstantial evidence

00:03:38.517 --> 00:03:42.354
of collusion between
President Trump and Russians.

00:03:42.354 --> 00:03:45.425
We should also forget about them
trying to obtain

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:49.128
nude pictures of Trump
from Russian pranksters.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.229
-Hey, man, I guarantee you,

00:03:50.229 --> 00:03:52.998
no one wants nude pics
of Donald Trump.

00:03:52.998 --> 00:03:56.135
I'm not crazy about clothed pics
of Donald Trump.

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:57.269
Also, I have to believe

00:03:57.269 --> 00:03:58.972
that if there were nude pics
of Donald Trump,

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:01.241
the first person to show them
to us would be Donald Trump.

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:03.142
He'd probably hold
a press conference

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.410
with a giant poster board.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.012
[ As Donald Trump ]
As you can see here,

00:04:06.012 --> 00:04:08.914
this was a selfie
I took on the toilet.

00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:10.649
[ Normal voice ]
Nunes also picked up on a theme

00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:12.551
right-wing pundits
have been pushing for weeks

00:04:12.551 --> 00:04:14.653
that the impeachment hearings
are just a show

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:16.422
concocted by Democrats for TV

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.958
as a sequel to
the Russia investigation.

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.093
-What we will witness today

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:23.329
is a televised
theatrical performance

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.298
staged by the Democrats.

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:28.200
It seems you agreed witting
or unwittingly

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.070
to participate in a drama.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:35.808
But the main performance,
the Russia hoax, has ended,

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:40.012
and you've been cast in
the low-rent Ukrainian sequel.

00:04:40.012 --> 00:04:43.115
-Impeachment isn't
the low-rent Ukrainian sequel.

00:04:43.115 --> 00:04:45.918
These guys are
the low-rent Ukrainian sequel.

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:48.154
Remember them?
Lev and Igor?

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:50.222
These are the real names
of Rudy's henchmen

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:52.825
who were arrested in part
for their role in the scandal.

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.593
At least the Russia
investigation

00:04:54.593 --> 00:04:57.263
had guys who looked like
Bond villains and Mafia dons.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:05:00.499
These guys look like they should
be Ivan Drago's cornermen

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:02.201
in "Rocky IV."

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:06.939
They look like balloons in the
annual Macy's day perp walk.

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:08.274
Now, compare the Republicans

00:05:08.274 --> 00:05:10.309
to the credibility
of the two witnesses --

00:05:10.309 --> 00:05:12.045
State Department official
George Kent

00:05:12.045 --> 00:05:13.445
and Ambassador Bill Taylor.

00:05:13.445 --> 00:05:15.981
Both witnesses directly tied
Trump's lawyer Rudy Giuliani

00:05:15.981 --> 00:05:17.283
to the Ukraine scheme,

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:20.153
with Kent using an especially
interesting phrase.

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:22.688
-Over the course
of 2018 and 2019,

00:05:22.688 --> 00:05:25.124
I became increasingly aware
of an effort

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:26.759
by Rudy Giuliani and others,

00:05:26.759 --> 00:05:29.795
including his associates
Lev Parnas and Igor Fruman,

00:05:29.795 --> 00:05:32.431
to run a campaign to smear
Ambassador Yovanovitch

00:05:32.431 --> 00:05:35.234
and other officials
at the U.S. embassy in Kiev.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:37.003
In mid-August,
it became clear to me

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.270
that Giuliani's efforts

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.773
to gin up politically motivated
investigations

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:43.275
were now infecting
U.S. engagement with Ukraine.

00:05:43.275 --> 00:05:46.145
-That's right, Rudy was
infecting Ukraine policy.

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:47.613
And that's the right word to use

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:50.249
because he looks like the human
version of the Mucinex man.

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:54.086
But Taylor -- Taylor
in particular is a key witness

00:05:54.086 --> 00:05:55.754
because he created
a written record

00:05:55.754 --> 00:05:57.056
of what was happening
at the time

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:59.492
by writing down his concerns
in text messages.

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:02.428
And he relayed those concerns
again in his testimony.

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:05.498
-I and others sat
in astonishment.

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:08.100
Ukrainians
were fighting Russians

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.903
and counted on not only
the training and weapons,

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:13.973
but also the assurance
of U.S. support.

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.509
The explanation made no sense.

00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:19.812
Ukrainians did not owe
President Trump anything.

00:06:19.812 --> 00:06:21.614
And holding up
security assistance

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:23.615
for domestic political gain
was crazy.

00:06:23.615 --> 00:06:24.817
-Yes, it was crazy,

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:27.053
which is exactly why
I believe Trump did it.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.321
Any time Trump has a choice

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:30.322
between doing the sane thing
and the crazy thing,

00:06:30.322 --> 00:06:31.524
he picks the crazy thing.

00:06:31.524 --> 00:06:33.825
That's true even when he stands.

00:06:33.825 --> 00:06:38.664
He has the choice between
standing like a normal person

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:41.567
or standing like a rooster
defending his nest,

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:44.770
and he always chooses rooster.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.339
Taylor also revealed
some damning new information,

00:06:47.339 --> 00:06:49.108
information he just
received recently.

00:06:49.108 --> 00:06:51.243
Taylor told the committee
that over the summer,

00:06:51.243 --> 00:06:52.611
during a trip to Ukraine,

00:06:52.611 --> 00:06:54.980
a member of his staff overheard
a phone call Trump had

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.983
with his handpicked ambassador
to the E.U., Gordon Sondland.

00:06:57.983 --> 00:07:00.252
In that call,
Trump asked Sondland directly

00:07:00.252 --> 00:07:01.521
about the investigations

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:03.789
he wanted Ukraine to conduct
of the Bidens.

00:07:03.789 --> 00:07:06.559
-Last Friday, a member
of my staff told me

00:07:06.559 --> 00:07:09.195
of events that occurred
on July 26th.

00:07:09.195 --> 00:07:12.031
A member of my staff accompanied
Ambassador Sondland.

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:14.066
Ambassador Sondland
called President Trump

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:17.603
and told him of his meetings
in Kiev.

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.938
The member of my staff
could hear President Trump

00:07:19.938 --> 00:07:22.074
on the phone asking
Ambassador Sondland

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.909
about the investigations.

00:07:23.909 --> 00:07:25.678
Following the call
with President Trump,

00:07:25.678 --> 00:07:28.214
the member of my staff
asked Ambassador Sondland

00:07:28.214 --> 00:07:30.716
what President Trump
thought about Ukraine.

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:33.452
Ambassador Sondland responded
that President Trump

00:07:33.452 --> 00:07:35.955
cares more about
the investigations of Biden,

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:37.690
which Giuliani was pressing for.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.092
-Once again, these guys are
the worst criminals in history.

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:41.260
Think about that.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.229
Trump talked to a henchman
on a phone call

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:45.197
about his plan to extort
a foreign country,

00:07:45.197 --> 00:07:48.401
and he was so loud,
people could overhear him.

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:50.937
A good criminal would call
and say, "Are you alone?"

00:07:50.937 --> 00:07:52.438
Trump would say, "Are you alone?

00:07:52.438 --> 00:07:54.740
If not, go find some people
to stand next to.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.710
Put me on speakerphone.
This is a doozy."

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.313
This is a major bombshell,
yet another piece of evidence

00:08:01.313 --> 00:08:03.615
that directly ties Trump himself
to this scheme.

00:08:03.615 --> 00:08:06.118
We have the transcript,
witnesses, text messages,

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:07.619
and now we have
a damning new phone call.

00:08:07.619 --> 00:08:10.322
If we had this much evidence
during the O.J. trial,

00:08:10.322 --> 00:08:12.124
even Johnnie Cochran would've
been like, "You know what?

00:08:12.124 --> 00:08:15.261
The glove does fit.
My client's full of [bleep]"

00:08:15.261 --> 00:08:18.063
This is yet another
new piece of evidence

00:08:18.063 --> 00:08:20.732
confirming that Trump had
committed impeachable offenses.

00:08:20.732 --> 00:08:22.735
In fact, George Conway
summed it all up

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:24.369
with his very straightforward
statement

00:08:24.369 --> 00:08:26.772
about just how damning
the facts have been for Trump.

00:08:26.772 --> 00:08:29.108
-It's the ultimate
impeachable offense.

00:08:29.108 --> 00:08:30.376
You can't --

00:08:30.376 --> 00:08:34.479
If you were going to make up
a set of facts

00:08:34.479 --> 00:08:39.552
that were as bad as you
could get, this would be it.

00:08:39.552 --> 00:08:41.186
-I agree,
and just a thought here,

00:08:41.186 --> 00:08:42.922
but maybe you could write
that down on a Post-it

00:08:42.922 --> 00:08:45.558
and leave it on your fridge.

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:47.726
What this hearing made clear
once again

00:08:47.726 --> 00:08:49.328
is Republicans have no defense.

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:50.796
They have nothing.

00:08:50.796 --> 00:08:52.831
For example, Republicans also
hired their own outside lawyer

00:08:52.831 --> 00:08:53.832
to question the witnesses.

00:08:53.832 --> 00:08:55.134
That lawyer tried to ask Taylor

00:08:55.134 --> 00:08:57.002
about Sondland's involvement
in the scheme.

00:08:57.002 --> 00:08:58.403
Again, as you'll recall,

00:08:58.403 --> 00:09:01.273
Sondland was Trump's handpicked
ambassador to the E.U.,

00:09:01.273 --> 00:09:02.741
not Ukraine.

00:09:02.741 --> 00:09:05.877
So it's suspicious he was
involved in any of this at all.

00:09:05.877 --> 00:09:08.180
The GOP lawyer tried
to get Taylor to say

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.682
that it wasn't suspicious.

00:09:09.682 --> 00:09:11.249
But his line of questioning
fell flat.

00:09:11.249 --> 00:09:16.255
-I want to turn
to the discussion

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:20.359
of the irregular channel
you describe.

00:09:20.359 --> 00:09:26.332
In fairness, this irregular
channel of diplomacy,

00:09:26.332 --> 00:09:30.803
it's not as outlandish
as it could be.

00:09:30.803 --> 00:09:31.937
Is that correct?

00:09:31.937 --> 00:09:34.406
-It's not as outlandish
as it could be.

00:09:34.406 --> 00:09:36.642
-That's their best argument --

00:09:36.642 --> 00:09:39.645
It's not as outlandish
as it could be.

00:09:39.645 --> 00:09:41.480
Trump should just run
all the way with that

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.882
and start holding his rallies
in front of a giant banner

00:09:43.882 --> 00:09:45.751
that says, "Not as guilty
as I could be."

00:09:45.751 --> 00:09:46.919
[ Laughter ]

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:48.053
The GOP lawyer kept going on

00:09:48.053 --> 00:09:49.589
with his bizarre
line of questioning

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:51.123
about Sondland's role
in the scheme.

00:09:51.123 --> 00:09:53.158
And eventually,
Taylor just gave up.

00:09:53.158 --> 00:09:54.493
-His involvement here,

00:09:54.493 --> 00:09:58.664
while not necessarily part
of his official duties

00:09:58.664 --> 00:09:59.965
as the ambassador to the E.U.,

00:09:59.965 --> 00:10:03.569
it certainly is not outlandish
for him to be interested

00:10:03.569 --> 00:10:06.472
and engaged pursuant
to the president

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:10.309
or Secretary Pompeo's direction,
correct?

00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:13.679
-It's a little unusual for
the U.S. ambassador to the E.U.

00:10:13.679 --> 00:10:17.149
to play a role
in Ukraine policy.

00:10:17.149 --> 00:10:18.718
-Okay.

00:10:18.718 --> 00:10:20.385
And, you know,
it might be irregular,

00:10:20.385 --> 00:10:22.621
but it's certainly
not outlandish.

00:10:22.621 --> 00:10:24.924
[ Laughter ]

00:10:26.092 --> 00:10:27.659
And then Secretary Perry --

00:10:27.659 --> 00:10:30.930
-I mean, that was --

00:10:33.031 --> 00:10:35.934
That was the entire series
of expressions you make

00:10:35.934 --> 00:10:37.603
when a guy comes up to you
on the subway

00:10:37.603 --> 00:10:39.638
and asks if you'd like
to touch his pet lizard.

00:10:39.638 --> 00:10:41.974
[ Laughter ]

00:10:47.479 --> 00:10:49.481
Although probably the best
moment of the hearing today

00:10:49.481 --> 00:10:51.383
came when Republican congressman
Jim Jordan

00:10:51.383 --> 00:10:52.952
kept obsessing over
the whistle-blower.

00:10:52.952 --> 00:10:54.720
-Now, there is one witness,

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.989
one witness that they won't
bring in front of us,

00:10:57.989 --> 00:11:00.059
they won't bring in front
of the American people.

00:11:00.059 --> 00:11:03.429
That's the guy who started
it all, the whistle-blower.

00:11:03.429 --> 00:11:07.599
-I say to my colleague,
I'd be glad to have the person

00:11:07.599 --> 00:11:09.601
who started it all
come in and testify.

00:11:09.601 --> 00:11:13.472
President Trump is welcome
to take a seat right there.

00:11:13.472 --> 00:11:14.907
-I would love
to see Trump testify.

00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:16.308
Can you imagine that?
After five minutes,

00:11:16.308 --> 00:11:17.776
Rudy would probably
be running into the room,

00:11:17.776 --> 00:11:19.477
screaming, "Boss, I got
all the evidence right here.

00:11:19.477 --> 00:11:20.913
It's in my Notes app."

00:11:20.913 --> 00:11:22.882
[ Laughter ]

00:11:22.882 --> 00:11:24.917
By the way,
while all this was happening,

00:11:24.917 --> 00:11:25.985
Trump was at the White House

00:11:25.985 --> 00:11:27.352
meeting with the president
of Turkey.

00:11:27.352 --> 00:11:29.087
Now, Trump retweeted
multiple clips of the hearing

00:11:29.087 --> 00:11:30.389
throughout the day.

00:11:30.389 --> 00:11:32.425
And yet he insisted
he wasn't watching the hearing

00:11:32.425 --> 00:11:33.592
because he didn't have time.

00:11:33.592 --> 00:11:35.293
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:11:35.293 --> 00:11:37.796
-No, I didn't.
I did not watch it.

00:11:37.796 --> 00:11:40.932
I'm too busy to watch it.
It's a witch hunt. It's a hoax.

00:11:40.932 --> 00:11:42.401
I'm too busy to watch it.

00:11:42.401 --> 00:11:44.670
-No, you weren't.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.638
There's no way
you were too busy to watch.

00:11:46.638 --> 00:11:48.040
Trump watches TV all the time.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.276
I'm shocked there wasn't a TV
next to him

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:52.310
while he was answering
that question.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.113
[ As Donald Trump ]
I'm too busy to watch. Hold on.

00:11:54.113 --> 00:11:55.780
Oh, no, they know
about the phone call.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.415
Oh [bleep]

00:11:57.415 --> 00:11:59.985
[ Normal voice ] Today was both
historic and deeply revealing.

00:11:59.985 --> 00:12:01.554
It's almost inevitable
that Trump will be

00:12:01.554 --> 00:12:03.288
the third president in history
to be impeached.

00:12:03.288 --> 00:12:05.324
Republicans made clear
they have no defense.

00:12:05.324 --> 00:12:08.193
Their best argument is that it
might be outlandish, but it's...

00:12:08.193 --> 00:12:12.731
-Not as outlandish
as it could be.

00:12:12.731 --> 00:12:15.167
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:17.737
[ Cheers and applause ]

